window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He's an Oxonian, licensed therapist, and man of faith, preparing to take over the largest Pentecostal church in New York.</p> <p>She's an around-the-way girl from Harlem, struggling with three jobs and school to make ends meet for so many.</p> <p>So, what could they possibly have in common? Find out how Ezra Carmichael and Lex Grier make a covenant, creating a sphere for both their worlds to harmonize.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
